WEBVTT

00:03:28.704 --> 00:03:31.079
(Laughter)

00:03:31.121 --> 00:03:34.329
that it made you question
how you’ve been saying it your whole life?

00:03:34.329 --> 00:03:35.829
(Laughter)

00:03:35.829 --> 00:03:37.454
She was so sure of herself,

00:03:37.496 --> 00:03:39.371
because someone tried to correct her --

00:03:39.371 --> 00:03:42.246
the woman behind her was like,
“Um, I think it’s Margherita?”

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:45.246
and she turned around and went,
“I said what I said.”

00:03:45.288 --> 00:03:46.663
(Laugther)

00:03:46.704 --> 00:03:49.746
I was like, “Oh, she did
say what she said.

00:03:49.746 --> 00:03:50.954
That’s crazy.”

00:03:51.579 --> 00:03:53.079
I want that kind of confidence.

00:03:53.079 --> 00:03:55.038
I was like, “She might be onto something.

00:03:55.038 --> 00:03:58.079
Let me get one of them
Peppe-ronnis, real quick.

00:03:58.121 --> 00:04:01.871
That’s right, throw
some ja-la-penos on there,